  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融研究專題(一)",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS IN FINANCIAL RESEARCH (I)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將介紹近期金融相關學術研究和實務的發展，協助學生了解金融市場現況。研讀最新金融文獻及探討實務議題，邀請學者、專家分享最新金融趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce the recent development of academic research and practice in finance area, and to help students understand the current situations of financial markets. Students will study the latest financial literature and discuss practical issues. Scholars and experts are invited to share the latest financial trends.",
    "pre_subname": "",
